    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37919" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-scisco</span></b> , ĕre, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch. a.</i>, <i>to find out</i>, or <i>learn
				beforehand</i> (not in Cic. or Cæs.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animos volgi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 70</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exploratam fugam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					9, 9, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adversos subitosque motus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 20, 6, 9</span></i>
			.—With <i>rel.-clause</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 27,
				35, 5</span></i>.</div>
